{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Admake Tab Bridge V5",
  "version": "5.3",
  "description": "Cáº§u ná»‘i AI Há»£p Nháº¥t: Tá»± Ä‘á»™ng hÃ³a ChatGPT xá»­ lÃ½ Truy váº¥n ná»™i dung, PhÃ¢n tÃ­ch Vision, TrÃ­ch xuáº¥t Ruby SketchUp 3D, Táº¡o áº£nh DALL-E & Inpainting vá»›i Ä‘á»‹nh tuyáº¿n theo Ä‘Ãºng tÃªn mÃ¡y (Target PC).",
  "permissions": [
